+# BP-065–BP-069 result analysis
+
+The Windows build completed and all inherited groups passed until BP-068.
+`MiniQuakeMenuLifecycleTests.exe` reported two fixture failures:
+
+```text
+sound volume tenth-step
+invert mouse
+```
+
+The production code follows `menu.c::M_AdjustSliders` and `Cvar_SetValue`.
+The fixture compared a stored C `float` directly with MiniLang source literals.
+After six-decimal serialization and reparsing, the authoritative values are:
+
+```text
+volume:  string=0.800000  bits=0x3f4ccccd
+m_pitch: string=-0.022000 bits=0xbcb43958
+```
+
+The test also executed 24 checks while labelling them `/22`. R1 corrects the
+expectations and reporting only. No engine or native source changed.
